{"rawHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n    \n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/favicon.svg\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AiVA — ClaudeAI-Powered Virtual Assistants</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"AiVA delivers ClaudeAI-powered virtual assistants that manage tasks, draft communications, and run your day-to-day operations. Pro and Agency plans available.\">\n    <script type=\"module\" crossorigin=\"\" src=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/assets/index-uzL_DAln.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/assets/index-BDqbDVn3.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <!-- Netlify Forms detection (hidden, never rendered) -->\n    <form name=\"contact\" netlify=\"\" netlify-honeypot=\"bot-field\">\n      <input name=\"name\">\n      <input name=\"email\">\n      <textarea name=\"message\"></textarea>\n    </form>\n    <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-navy-900\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 \"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-claude-orange to-claude-orange-light flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/20\">A</div><span class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight\">AiVA</span></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-400\"><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#benefits\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Benefits</a><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#how-it-works\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">How It Works</a><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#pricing\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pricing</a><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#contact\" class=\"px-5 py-2 bg-claude-orange text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-claude-orange-light transition-all shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/20\">Get Your AiVA</a></div></div></nav><div class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/hero-bg.jpg\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy-900 via-navy-900/85 to-navy-900/50\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy-900 via-transparent to-navy-900/60\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><div class=\"inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-xs font-medium tracking-wider uppercase text-claude-orange border border-claude-orange/30 rounded-full bg-claude-orange/5\">Powered by Claude AI</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6\">Your Brilliant<br><span class=\"text-claude-orange\">Right Hand</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed\">Imagine an assistant who knows your business, anticipates your needs, and handles the thousand small things that eat your day — so you can focus on the big moves.</p><p class=\"text-base text-gray-400 max-w-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed\">AiVA is a ClaudeAI-powered virtual assistant that works 24/7 across your favorite channels. It doesn't just respond — it <em class=\"text-white not-italic font-medium\">takes action</em>.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\"><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#pricing\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 bg-claude-orange text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-claude-orange-light transition-all shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/25 text-center\">Get Your AiVA</a><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#benefits\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-all text-center\">See What's Possible</a></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block\"></div> </div></div><div class=\"bg-surface-light border-y border-white/5 py-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 md:gap-16 text-sm text-gray-500\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">24/7</span><span>Always On</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">3</span><span>Channels Supported</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">&lt;24h</span><span>Setup Time</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">100%</span><span>Private &amp; Isolated</span></div></div></div><section id=\"benefits\" class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-claude-orange font-medium text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3\">What Changes When You Have an AiVA</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Stop Managing Tasks.<br>Start Running Your Business.</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto\">The average business leader spends 3+ hours a day on work that isn't their job. AiVA takes that back.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">🎯</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">Never Drop the Ball Again</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA tracks every task, deadline, and follow-up across all your conversations. When something needs doing, it flags it — or just handles it. No more sticky notes. No more \"I forgot.\"</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">✍️</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">Every Message, In Your Voice</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Need to respond to 30 emails before lunch? AiVA drafts them in your tone, your style. Review and send, or let it handle the routine ones. Your clients won't know the difference — because it sounds like you.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">🔎</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">Research in Minutes, Not Hours</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\"Find me the top 5 competitors in this space.\" \"What did our contract with Acme say about renewal terms?\" AiVA searches, summarizes, and delivers answers — not links. Real answers you can act on.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">📅</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">Your Calendar, Under Control</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Double-booked? Not anymore. AiVA manages your schedule, flags conflicts before they happen, and suggests optimal times. It learns your patterns — when you like meetings, when you need focus time.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">🗺️</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">From Big Idea to Action Plan</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\"I want to launch a podcast.\" AiVA turns that into 15 actionable steps with timelines, dependencies, and priorities. Big goals become manageable plans. Vague ideas become concrete next actions.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5 hover:border-claude-orange/20 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-4\">🧠</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-claude-orange transition-colors\">It Gets Smarter Every Day</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA remembers your preferences, your projects, your people. It builds context over weeks and months. Six months in, it knows your business almost as well as you do — and it never forgets a detail.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-claude-orange font-medium text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3\">Ridiculously Simple</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Up and Running Before Your Next Meeting</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center p-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-claude-orange/10 border border-claude-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center text-claude-orange font-mono font-bold text-lg mx-auto mb-5\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">Tell Us What You Need</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">A quick conversation about your workflow, your communication style, and the channels you live in — Telegram, WhatsApp, or Discord. We configure your assistant's personality to match yours.</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-claude-orange/10 border border-claude-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center text-claude-orange font-mono font-bold text-lg mx-auto mb-5\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">We Deploy Your Private Instance</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Your AiVA runs on a dedicated server. Not shared. Not multi-tenant. Your data, your conversations, your business context — completely isolated. It's yours.</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-claude-orange/10 border border-claude-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center text-claude-orange font-mono font-bold text-lg mx-auto mb-5\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">Start Delegating</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Send AiVA a message like you'd text a human assistant. \"Remind me to follow up with Sarah on Thursday.\" \"Draft a response to this email.\" \"What's on my plate this week?\" It just works.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-claude-orange font-medium text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3\">Not a Chatbot</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">The Difference Between Answering and Doing</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Most AI tools answer questions. AiVA takes action. That's not a marketing line — it's an architectural decision.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/5 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"p-8 bg-surface\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">It Uses Real Tools</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA doesn't just generate text — it searches the web, creates documents, manages files, and sends messages on your behalf. When you say \"find out,\" it actually finds out.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-surface\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">It Remembers Everything</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\"You mentioned last Tuesday that the Acme deal was stalling because of pricing.\" AiVA builds a working memory of your world. No re-explaining. No lost context.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-surface\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">It Lives Where You Do</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Not another app to check. Not another dashboard to log into. AiVA meets you in Telegram, WhatsApp, or Discord — the tools already on your phone.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-surface\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3\">It's Yours Alone</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Every client gets a dedicated, isolated deployment. Your assistant doesn't share memory, context, or infrastructure with anyone else. Private by architecture, not just by policy.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-claude-orange font-medium text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3\">Real Scenarios</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">What Does a Day With AiVA Look Like?</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 md:gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 pt-1.5 w-16 shrink-0 text-right\">7:30 AM</div><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium mb-2 italic\">\"Good morning. What do I need to know today?\"</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA gives you a morning briefing: 3 meetings, 2 follow-ups due, 1 contract expiring this week, and a reminder that Sarah's birthday is tomorrow.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 md:gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 pt-1.5 w-16 shrink-0 text-right\">9:15 AM</div><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium mb-2 italic\">\"Draft a follow-up to the call with DataCorp yesterday. Mention the pricing discussion and suggest a Thursday demo.\"</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA drafts the email in your tone, references the specific points from yesterday, and asks if you want to send or edit first.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 md:gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 pt-1.5 w-16 shrink-0 text-right\">1:00 PM</div><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium mb-2 italic\">\"What are the top 3 project management tools for teams under 20 people? Compare pricing.\"</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">AiVA researches, compares, and delivers a summary table with pricing, key features, and a recommendation based on your team size.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 md:gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 pt-1.5 w-16 shrink-0 text-right\">4:45 PM</div><div class=\"flex-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium mb-2 italic\">\"Remind me to review the Q2 budget proposal Monday morning, and block 90 minutes for it.\"</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Done. Calendar blocked, reminder set. AiVA will nudge you Monday at 8:30 AM with the document attached.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><p class=\"text-claude-orange font-medium text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3\">Simple, Honest Pricing</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Less Than a Part-Time Hire.<br>More Than a Full-Time Assistant.</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto\">No hidden fees. No per-message charges. Flat monthly rate, cancel anytime.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-1\">Pro</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">For founders, freelancers, and solo operators</p></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-white\">$149</span><span class=\"text-gray-500\">/mo</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">One brilliant assistant on your channel of choice. Handles tasks, communications, research, and scheduling.</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>5,000 AI interactions per month</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>Telegram, WhatsApp, or Discord</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>Custom personality &amp; communication style</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>Persistent memory across sessions</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>Dedicated private instance</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-accent-teal mt-0.5\">✓</span>Email support</li></ul><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#contact\" class=\"block text-center py-3.5 border border-white/10 text-white rounded-xl hover:border-claude-orange hover:text-claude-orange transition-all font-medium\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border-2 border-claude-orange/40 flex flex-col relative\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 right-6 px-4 py-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-claude-orange to-claude-orange-light text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/20\">Best Value</div><div class=\"mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-1\">Agency</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">For teams and growing businesses</p></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-white\">$399</span><span class=\"text-gray-500\">/mo</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">A full AI operations team. Your main assistant plus specialized agents for communications and operations.</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>30,000 AI interactions per month</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>All channels — Telegram, WhatsApp &amp; Discord</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>Main + Comms + Ops agents</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>Mission Control dashboard</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>Custom persona per agent</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400\"><span class=\"text-claude-orange mt-0.5\">✓</span>Priority support &amp; onboarding call</li></ul><a href=\"https://m2aivoicebots.com/#contact\" class=\"block text-center py-3.5 bg-claude-orange text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-claude-orange-light transition-all font-medium shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/20\">Get Started</a></div></div></section><section class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Questions? Answers.</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full text-left p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-white font-medium text-sm\">How is this different from ChatGPT or other AI chatbots?</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 text-xl shrink-0\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full text-left p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-white font-medium text-sm\">Is my data safe?</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 text-xl shrink-0\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full text-left p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-white font-medium text-sm\">What if I need more interactions than my plan includes?</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 text-xl shrink-0\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full text-left p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-white font-medium text-sm\">Can AiVA work with my existing tools?</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 text-xl shrink-0\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"border border-white/5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full text-left p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\"><span class=\"text-white font-medium text-sm\">How long does setup take?</span><span class=\"text-gray-600 text-xl shrink-0\">+</span></button></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"transition-all duration-700 opacity-100 translate-y-0 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24\"><div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-surface-light border border-white/5\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Ready to Get Your Time Back?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400\">Tell us about your business and we'll show you what AiVA can handle for you.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-4 max-w-lg mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><input placeholder=\"Your Name\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-claude-orange transition-colors\" type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"name\"><input placeholder=\"Email Address\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-claude-orange transition-colors\" type=\"email\" value=\"\" name=\"email\"></div><textarea name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your business and what you need help with...\" rows=\"4\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 border border-white/10 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-claude-orange transition-colors resize-none\"></textarea><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3.5 bg-claude-orange text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-claude-orange-light transition-all shadow-lg shadow-claude-orange/20 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">Let's Talk</button></form></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-white/5 py-8 px-6 mt-12\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-claude-orange to-claude-orange-light flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-[10px]\">A</div><span>AiVA by M2AI</span></div><p>© 2026 M2AI. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer></div></div>\n  \n\n</body></html>","metadata":{"title":"AiVA — ClaudeAI-Powered Virtual Assistants","language":"en","viewport":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0","description":"AiVA delivers ClaudeAI-powered virtual assistants that manage tasks, draft communications, and run your day-to-day operations. Pro and Agency plans available.","favicon":"https://m2aivoicebots.com/favicon.svg","scrapeId":"019d54e2-39e7-7691-99cf-76bcd38a0666","sourceURL":"https://m2aivoicebots.com","url":"https://m2aivoicebots.com/","statusCode":200,"contentType":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","proxyUsed":"basic","cacheState":"hit","cachedAt":"2026-04-03T19:46:34.052Z","creditsUsed":1,"concurrencyLimited":false}}